Gates for the #73 oops fix, branch 73-oops-fix, 2026-10-22
Commit: 31a15689bec847a51357d4dcacc361a4986b548a. Fresh clone from GitHub on sigil-fpga-build, detached at that SHA,
  `git status --porcelain` empty before and after. Worktrees of the same clone at the same SHA ran the boot, oops and ACT
  steps. deps/ and third_party/ were linked from the rel73 gate setup (~/rel73/sigil): Verilator 5.048 and the pinned GCC.
Host: sigil-fpga-build (AWS r7iz.8xlarge, 32 vCPU, Ubuntu 24.04). The hunters' Linux sims and the AFI build ran there too.
  The Verilator 5.044 lint ran on macOS.
Base for the before/after: origin/73-linux-release 5458d16 (main + F2 platform + Linux).

